You could look into XLConnect. Another work-around that I sometimes use when I want the user to be able to download something with VBA code is to have a pre-set Excel template, paste the data into a csv, then use the R system() command to call a vb script which pushes those CSVs into the correct Excel tabs (and then save the new Excel into the location specified by the file argument in Shiny). Obviously this can be quite a pain so you may just want to write them into a zipped folder.

