Jeff, I cannot really say anything about this error. One suggestion, which you probably have already considered: add a suitable jquery lib for shiny-server.js and shiny-server-pro.js using the compatibility mode: http://learn.jquery.com/using-jquery-core/avoid-conflicts-other-libraries . This would require changes to both scripts but will shield them from any custom scripts that an iframe uses.

