Subject: Re: How to implement a function that adds attributes to html tag?
Message-ID: <6j87S7nuhQA.uZxEQHTICFEJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <6j87S7nuhQA.eX1xsWK5PSwJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
References: <6j87S7nuhQA.7o9nX2CtFy0J@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com> <6j87S7nuhQA.eX1xsWK5PSwJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
